    refactor(api): delete orphaned recent-feed hooks (#628)

    useRecentAgentThreads, useRecentWatcherRuns and useRecentRuns have had no
    consumers since #614 removed the sidebar Recent section. Verified against
    origin/main: each grep returns only its own definition, and useRecentRuns
    was reached solely through useRecentWatcherRuns.

    Removing useRecentAgentThreads also retires the SPA's only scope="all"
    caller, so fetchAgentThreads and agentThreadsQueryOptions drop the option
    and the query key collapses to [agent-threads, orgSlug, agentId]. The
    server keeps ?scope=all: manage_conversations list still uses it for
    admins.

